      <Description>
        <desc cnt="0" value="Postprocessing of output from W2 Whiskeytown Reservoir for use my downstream model compontents: 1) Add Spring Creek Debris Dam flow to Spring Creek tunnel outflow, to keep Keswick balanced; 2) Add contant tunnel heating to the Spring Creek tunnel outflow temperature." />
